	(text "1.	Use the USB_SEL header to determine which system the USB interfaces with:\n		- Connect pins 1&2 for UART\n		- Connect pins 2&3 for direct connection to the MCU\n\n2. 	If powering the breakout via external 3.3V, you MUST open the EN_REGULATOR jumper."
